{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB真人騷《女神配對計劃2》近日爆出嚴重意外，陳星妤與陳若思在水上遊戲環節爆發激烈肢體衝突。女方遭對手猛烈施 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB真人騷《女神配對計劃2》近日爆出嚴重意外，陳星妤與陳若思在水上遊戲環節爆發激烈肢體衝突。女方遭對手猛烈施襲導致身體多處嚴重挫傷，恐怖畫面曝光後瞬間觸發全網討伐。事件更令其中一方甜美形象徹底崩壞，隨後爆發連串公關災難。</p>\n<h2>陳星妤猛攻扯衫兼「奪命叉頸」 跌落水仍強行壓頂</h2>\n<p>在節目水上騎膊馬對決環節中，陳星妤與陳若思正面交鋒時場面完全失控。畫面清楚顯示陳星妤先是一手扯住對手衣服並出手推臉，其後演變成雙手反手箍頸強行將對方扭向下方。當陳若思失去平衡跌落水中時，陳星妤更整個人雙腳凌空壓在對方身上，用力將其頭部強行撳入水中。連串近乎摔角鎖喉動作令現場所有人嚇呆，完全超出普通遊戲應有分寸。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827303340148_6438464306ae7fc31448ec.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"LHKOEjk4lAAs7nHj4LhBVyb5Qb0CZ6bwenB7tnpwe7Y.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827303340148_6438464306ae7fc31448ec.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827478652934_13805333776ae7fc32ea748.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"gCdNsaTZW2uG19_Arm_8abx5UwAgA06j-84Tz_vOE88.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827478652934_13805333776ae7fc32ea748.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827658719337_20973314026ae7fc34bdc9d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"KR2fczhrxAGFDmF8MKiZA7jurTRPA-fgbt37O27d-zs.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827658719337_20973314026ae7fc34bdc9d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827820236363_8224151936ae7fc3663570.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"885485152_17912866527476871_314788948653411688_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827820236363_8224151936ae7fc3663570.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>猛攻扯衫兼「奪命叉頸」（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827967788097_5678980106ae7fc37d311e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"884550610_17912866578476871_3335822974036866383_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827967788097_5678980106ae7fc37d311e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828137726309_16066946876ae7fc39808bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"881132498_17912866629476871_315337456573272813_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828137726309_16066946876ae7fc39808bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>陳若思曬頸部大片紅腫傷痕 網民怒斥：究竟玩遊戲定殺人</h2>\n<p>賽後陳若思在社交平台公開傷勢照片，其頸部及鎖骨周圍出現大面積紅腫及明顯瘀傷。大批觀眾隨即在社交平台洗版炮轟，直指陳星妤手段極度粗暴。網民紛紛留言直斥「玩個遊戲啫，使唔使咁大力？又箍頸又撳人落水，你玩遊戲定攞人命？太恐怖！」以及「反手箍頸，尊攻人哋條頸，頸部神經血管咁多，出事真係好危險！」，更有觀眾狠批施襲者勝負欲過強且心狠手辣，要求其立即退出節目。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828249060725_6093029766ae7fc3ab251a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"884502266_18646242478020348_3531671279752995346_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828249060725_6093029766ae7fc3ab251a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>陳星妤發文自責道歉稱「太投入」</h2>\n<p>面對排山倒海抨擊，陳星妤隨後轉發陳若思受傷動態並發表公開道歉聲明。她在文中表示「睇返今次節目，我有認真反省。當時太投入比賽了，冇控制分寸同力度，心裏真係唔好受。Amber，抱歉令你受傷了。見到你嘅瘀傷，我好自責，希望你快啲好返」。她試圖透過自責言論平息觀眾怒火，將過火行為歸咎於比賽過於投入，未有拿捏好遊戲尺度。</p>\n<h2>網民不收貨批陳星妤綠茶道歉</h2>\n<p>儘管陳星妤已經低頭認錯，但大批網民對其道歉聲明完全不買賬。網民認定其舉動純粹因輿論發酵才作公關挽尊，紛紛留言炮轟「要睇完觀眾咁多負評先識反省，你覺得觀眾會改觀咩？」、「專登網上道歉畀人睇，成個post都好有綠茶味」。更有觀眾指出「現場弄傷人嗰陣唔見你即刻收手道歉」，形容其外表與行為落差極大，直斥「睇到你人品，心地都幾壞」，令其一貫甜美形象瞬間毀於一旦。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828580979836_18459924476ae7fc3defa9c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-02 at 10.44.56.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828580979836_18459924476ae7fc3defa9c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828688614268_19406008836ae7fc3f14492.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-02 at 10.44.45.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828688614268_19406008836ae7fc3f14492.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828803631106_1359134256ae7fc40261ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-02 at 10.44.32.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828803631106_1359134256ae7fc40261ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828853553954_14174253446ae7fc40abff1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-02 at 10.43.56 (1).jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828853553954_14174253446ae7fc40abff1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828938378331_14098692836ae7fc4184b3e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-02 at 10.50.21.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828938378331_14098692836ae7fc4184b3e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e%e9%85%8d%e5%b0%8d%e8%a8%88%e5%8a%832/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">女神配對計劃2</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e6%98%9f%e5%a6%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳星妤</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e8%8b%a5%e6%80%9d/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳若思</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3534201\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 2 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T04:21:12.067159+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1411,"images":12,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T02:58:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:18:16.946277+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:18:59.653242+00:00","content_hash":"78494ef5a06492fdb387aab8cf8c4ff1c5553596823857f9607bc344036a2b9d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}